BavarianData: Connect Home Assistant to BMW CarData
===================================================

This project began as a continuation of:

    bmw-cardata-ha (originally published as "BimmerData Streamline")
    Author:  JjyKsi
    Source:  https://github.com/JjyKsi/bmw-cardata-ha

The original author released that work into the public domain, stating in the
project README: "This project is released into the public domain. Do whatever
you want with it ... No attribution required (though appreciated)."

Because the original work carries no licensing restrictions, this project is
distributed under the MIT License (see the LICENSE file). We nonetheless credit
the original author here, as a matter of courtesy and respect for their work.

This project has since been substantially rewritten and now ships as
"BavarianData: Connect Home Assistant to BMW CarData" (domain `bavariandata`),
with alignment to the published BMW CarData API specification, additional API
endpoints, a bundled Lovelace card and vehicle image, a regenerated descriptor
catalogue, and a security and code-quality review.

